    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Last Fuse</i>, your greatest weapon is also your greatest threat. Build a nuclear bomb in the heart of a city, using its energy to power defenses against relentless alien attacks. But tapping into its power pushes it closer to meltdown. Manage crazy engineers, balance scarce resources, and push the limits with risky upgrades like bomb overdrive. Research alien tech, make high-stakes decisions, and fight to survive the chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Bomb: Your Power and Your Doom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/92953d059efeb858e6abf8f98cf2ed7c.poster.avif?t=1744395596\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/92953d059efeb858e6abf8f98cf2ed7c.webm?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/92953d059efeb858e6abf8f98cf2ed7c.mp4?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bomb is your greatest asset, but also your greatest threat. It generates energy to power your defenses, but the more you use it, the hotter it gets. Manage its heat carefully, or you\u2019ll push it to meltdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overclock your bomb for more energy, take bigger risks, and power up your defenses - but let the heat max out, and your city won\u2019t be standing for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/78800df397cdacb26cc175345b8f8b0a.poster.avif?t=1744395596\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/78800df397cdacb26cc175345b8f8b0a.webm?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/78800df397cdacb26cc175345b8f8b0a.mp4?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend Against Relentless Alien Attacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019re coming. They won\u2019t stop. Set up turrets, upgrade your defenses, and hold the line - all while keeping your bomb from turning your city into a crater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/b7e560fe57cdbad2aa6e294c71800c2a.poster.avif?t=1744395596\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/b7e560fe57cdbad2aa6e294c71800c2a.webm?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/b7e560fe57cdbad2aa6e294c71800c2a.mp4?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the Bomb, Gather Resources, Stay Alive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steel, titanium, coolant...every resource counts. Manage your economy, balance construction speed with energy needs, and prepare for the inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/d2386f5b2080423b1d06d3562404c43f.poster.avif?t=1744395596\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/d2386f5b2080423b1d06d3562404c43f.webm?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/d2386f5b2080423b1d06d3562404c43f.mp4?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness alien technology for upgrades.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research permanent upgrades that make each subsequent run easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/e2fa1d24b8e9e11740a951e23fd22c32.poster.avif?t=1744395596\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/e2fa1d24b8e9e11740a951e23fd22c32.webm?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/e2fa1d24b8e9e11740a951e23fd22c32.mp4?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Bomb, Choose Your Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the icy Frostcore to the volatile Overdrive Reactor, each bomb comes with unique perks and challenges. Will you harness controlled power or risk total meltdown for greater rewards?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/e3328f9d1492f14b6b3a75941b687476.poster.avif?t=1744395596\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/e3328f9d1492f14b6b3a75941b687476.webm?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/e3328f9d1492f14b6b3a75941b687476.mp4?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic weather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blinding storms, eerie nights, scorching heat...weather isn\u2019t just for show. It affects visibility, energy production, and even your defenses. Adapt or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/0cfb3b2ba4978b64cb0a0cfa3b1e692f.poster.avif?t=1744395596\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/0cfb3b2ba4978b64cb0a0cfa3b1e692f.webm?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/0cfb3b2ba4978b64cb0a0cfa3b1e692f.mp4?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Last Fuse</i>, your greatest weapon is also your greatest threat. Build a nuclear bomb in the heart of a city, using its energy to power defenses against relentless alien attacks. But tapping into its power pushes it closer to meltdown. Manage crazy engineers, balance scarce resources, and push the limits with risky upgrades like bomb overdrive. Research alien tech, make high-stakes decisions, and fight to survive the chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Bomb: Your Power and Your Doom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/92953d059efeb858e6abf8f98cf2ed7c.poster.avif?t=1744395596\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/92953d059efeb858e6abf8f98cf2ed7c.webm?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/92953d059efeb858e6abf8f98cf2ed7c.mp4?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bomb is your greatest asset, but also your greatest threat. It generates energy to power your defenses, but the more you use it, the hotter it gets. Manage its heat carefully, or you\u2019ll push it to meltdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overclock your bomb for more energy, take bigger risks, and power up your defenses - but let the heat max out, and your city won\u2019t be standing for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/78800df397cdacb26cc175345b8f8b0a.poster.avif?t=1744395596\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/355