sibility, energy production, and even your defenses. Adapt or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/0cfb3b2ba4978b64cb0a0cfa3b1e692f.poster.avif?t=1744395596\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/0cfb3b2ba4978b64cb0a0cfa3b1e692f.webm?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558060/extras/0cfb3b2ba4978b64cb0a0cfa3b1e692f.mp4?t=1744395596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
